---

<Layout>
	<section class="mb-5">
		<h1>TED® Hair Restoration</h1>
		<p class="text-xl bg-[#EEE8E0] px-2">Pre-Treatment Instructions</p>
	</section>
	<section>
		<div class="separation">
			<h2>About TED®</h2>
			<p>TED® is a non-invasive ultrasound-based treatment that delivers a proprietary hair growth serum into the scalp without needles.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="separation">
			<h2>Who May Benefit?</h2>
			<p>	• Male pattern hair loss <br>
				• Female pattern hair loss <br>
				• Hair thinning <br>
				• Excessive hair shedding <br>
				• Patients seeking a needle-free option <br>
			</p>
		</div>

		
	</section>
</Layout>